     "content": {
      "size": -1,
      "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
      "text": "{\"template\":\"WorkspaceInvitation\",\"language\":\"en\",\"subject\":\"You're invited to join Al Noor Academy on Teach Tandem\",\"fromDisplayName\":\"Al Noor Academy via Teach Tandem\",\"replyTo\":\"tutor@example.com\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"color-scheme\\\" content=\\\"light dark\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"supported-color-schemes\\\" content=\\\"light dark\\\">\\n<title>You&#39;re invited to join Al Noor Academy on Teach Tandem</title>\\n<style>\\n  body { margin:0; padding:0; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; }\\n  @media (max-width:620px) {\\n    .tt-outer { padding:12px 8px !important; }\\n    .tt-card { padding:24px 20px !important; }\\n  }\\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark) {\\n    .tt-bg { background:#14100C !important; }\\n    .tt-card { background:#221A12 !important; border-color:#3A2E22 !important; }\\n    .tt-text, .tt-wordmark { color:#F3ECD8 !important; }\\n    .tt-muted { color:#CDBD9C !important; }\\n    .tt-link { color:#F0B4B4 !important; }\\n  }\\n  [data-ogsc] .tt-text, [data-ogsc] .tt-wordmark { color:#F3ECD8 !important; }\\n  [data-ogsc] .tt-muted { color:#CDBD9C !important; }\\n  [data-ogsc] .tt-link { color:#F0B4B4 !important; }\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body class=\\\"tt-bg\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F3ECD8;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"display:none;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#F3ECD8;\\\">Mohamed Ali invited you to join Al Noor Academy.&#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; &#8199;&#847; </div>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" class=\\\"tt-bg\\\" style=\\\"background:#F3ECD8;\\\">\\n<tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" class=\\\"tt-outer\\\" style=\\\"padding:24px 12px;\\\">\\n<!--[if mso]><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td><![endif]-->\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"max-width:600px;width:100%;\\\">\\n<tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" style=\\\"padding:4px 4px 16px;text-align:left;\\\"><span class=\\\"tt-wordmark\\\" style=\\\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#7A2E2E;\\\">Teach Tandem</span></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"tt-card\\\" align=\\\"left\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E5D9BC;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"tt-text\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#241A10;\\\">Hi,</p>\\n<p class=\\\"tt-text\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#241A10;\\\">Mohamed Ali has invited you to join Al Noor Academy on Teach Tandem as a learner.</p><p class=\\\"tt-text\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#241A10;\\\">Accept the invitation to set up your account and get started.</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin:8px 0 24px;\\\">\\n<tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" bgcolor=\\\"#7A2E2E\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:8px;background:#7A2E2E;\\\">\\n<a href=\\\"https://app.teachtandem.com/invite/SAMPLE-TOKEN-not-a-real-link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;\\\">Accept invitation</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n<p class=\\\"tt-muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#6E5C43;\\\">Button not working? Copy this link:</p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;word-break:break-all;\\\"><a class=\\\"tt-link\\\" href=\\\"https://app.teachtandem.com/invite/SAMPLE-TOKEN-not-a-real-link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"color:#7A2E2E;text-decoration:underline;\\\">https://app.teachtandem.com/invite/SAMPLE-TOKEN-not-a-real-link</a></p>\\n<p class=\\\"tt-muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#6E5C43;\\\">This link expires in 7 days and can only be used once.</p>\\n<p class=\\\"tt-muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#6E5C43;\\\">If you weren&#39;t expecting this email, you can ignore it.</p>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td align=\\\"left\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"padding:20px 8px 8px;text-align:left;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"tt-text\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;color:#241A10;\\\">Al Noor Academy</p>\\n<p class=\\\"tt-muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6E5C43;\\\">Sent via Teach Tandem</p>\\n<p class=\\\"tt-muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6E5C43;\\\">Need help? <a class=\\\"tt-link\\\" href=\\\"https://teachtandem.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" style=\\\"color:#7A2E2E;text-decoration:underline;\\\">Contact us</a></p>\\n<p class=\\\"tt-muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6E5C43;\\\">&#169; 2026 Teach Tandem &middot; <a class=\\\"tt-link\\\" href=\\\"https://teachtandem.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"color:#7A2E2E;text-decoration:underline;\\\">teachtandem.com</a></p>\\n</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\\n</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"Hi,\\n\\nMohamed Ali has invited you to join Al Noor Academy on Teach Tandem as a learner.\\n\\nAccept the invitation to set up your account and get started.\\n\\nAccept invitation:\\nhttps://app.teachtandem.com/invite/SAMPLE-TOKEN-not-a-real-link\\n\\nThis link expires in 7 days and can only be used once.\\n\\nIf you weren't expecting this email, you can ignore it.\\n\\n--\\nAl Noor Academy\\nSent via Teach Tandem\\nNeed help? https://teachtandem.com\\n© 2026 Teach Tandem · https://teachtandem.com\\n\"}"
     },
